493 0 obj
  << /ActualText (What is good design\077 This is a question I often return to because what surrounds design interests me as much as design itself\056 Good design arrives at the intersection of a designer\031s creativity\054 their fluency with methods that reveal the user\031s point of view\054 and their instinct for strategy\056 It\031s what lets a designer reconcile what the business wants with what the user needs and what the system allows into one solution that serves all three\056)
     /K [ 6 ]
     /P 494 0 R
     /Pg 481 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
