507 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Strategic foresight isn\047t prediction\056 It\047s asking what the thing we build today will need to become once the world around it has moved\056\n\nProducts shift\056 Environments shift\056 Even personas expire\056 Methods that model and monitor those shifts give a team something to design toward\054 rather than a present to optimize for\054 or a competitor to match\056)
     /K [ 13 ]
     /P 508 0 R
     /Pg 481 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
