521 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Every product we design is a moment within a larger tapestry of experiences and user decisions\056 \n\nBy mapping these systems as both networks of interconnected nodes and as layered structures of front\055stage\054 back\055stage\054 and supporting services\054 we can understand how a design choice ripples across the wider experience\054 and design with the whole picture in view\056)
     /K [ 20 ]
     /P 522 0 R
