529 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Human\055centered design is not a mantra\073 it\031s an approach to realize the potential of a product by building experiences that go beyond what users could envision for themselves\056 \n\nThrough dedicated research and stakeholder collaboration\054 we are able to develop a shared understanding that transitions ideas into practice\056)
     /K [ 24 ]
     /P 530 0 R
