533 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Business design is the orchestration of business goals\054 user needs\054 and development realities into a strategy that\047s valuable\054 feasible\054 and viable\056 \n\nWhen done well\054 it is what separates a product that ships and performs from one that simply gets built and exists\056 It\047s the difference that will lead to growth and recognition\056)
     /K [ 26 ]
     /P 534 0 R
     /Pg 481 0 R
